OL,3,GNEWSAThe empty shoes that tell of 103  
OL,4,Awomen's lives lost                     
OL,6,FMore than 100 pairs of shoes will be   
OL,7,Flaid out in Coventry city centre on    
OL,8,FSaturday to commemorate women who have 
OL,9,Fbeen killed by men in the UK over the  
OL,10,Fpast year.                             
OL,12,FThe display, organised by Coventry     
OL,13,FCounts Dead Women, will feature 103    
OL,14,Fpairs of shoes - one pair for each of  
OL,15,Fthe women whose names will be read out 
OL,16,Fon the hour, every hour, alongside     
OL,17,Fspeeches and poetry.                   
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
