OL,3,GNEWSAThe empty shoes that tell of 103  
OL,4,Awomen's lives lost                     
OL,6,FOrganiser Tracey Cownden said the      
OL,7,Fevent, which aimed to not only remember
OL,8,Fthose who had lost their lives but     
OL,9,Fraise awareness of violence against    
OL,10,Fwomen and girls, was always moving.    
OL,12,F"It is harrowing the stories we hear on
OL,13,Fthe day of survivors and members of the
OL,14,Fpublic who come up and share how they  
OL,15,Fhave escaped or witnessed their mothers
OL,16,Fbeing beaten as children ` but it is so
OL,17,Fimportant," she said.                  
